<section class="simple-tool" data-data-shaper aria-labelledby="data-workbench-title">
  <div class="simple-tool__controls simple-tool__controls--single">
    <label><span data-i18n="data.delimiter">分隔符</span><select data-delimiter><option value="," data-i18n="data.csv">逗号（CSV）</option><option value="tab" data-i18n="data.tsv">制表符（TSV）</option></select></label>
    <label class="file-picker"><span data-i18n="data.file">选择 CSV 或 TSV 文件</span><input type="file" accept=".csv,.tsv,text/csv,text/tab-separated-values" data-data-file /></label>
  </div>
  <p role="status" aria-live="polite" data-data-status data-i18n="data.status.empty">等待选择表格文件</p>
  <p role="alert" data-data-error hidden></p>
  <div class="data-actions"><button type="button" data-clean disabled data-i18n="data.clean">清理单元格并移除空白行</button><button type="button" data-download disabled data-i18n="data.download">下载整理后的 CSV</button></div>
  <section data-data-preview hidden aria-labelledby="data-workbench-title">
    <h2 id="data-workbench-title" data-i18n="data.preview">数据预览</h2>
    <div class="data-table-wrap"><table><caption class="visually-hidden" data-i18n="data.preview">数据预览</caption><tbody data-data-table></tbody></table></div>
  </section>
  <p class="simple-tool__note" data-i18n="data.note">预览最多显示前 8 行；清理会去除单元格首尾空白并移除全空行。最大文件大小为 10 MB，最多解析 250,000 个单元格。</p>
</section>
